{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1732340431_9840560_4c4f7ec215aa012dbd9ace982032cec8.png",
  "description": "<h3 style=\"padding:0px;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;white-space:normal;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:13pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">1. Affiliate Eligibility</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">To participate in the Yufta Affiliate Program, you must meet the following criteria:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px 0pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Have an active social media account, online platform, or any other channel with a dedicated following of at least </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">10k</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> or more.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px 12pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Agree to comply with all applicable laws, rules, and regulations.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<hr style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding:0px;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;white-space:normal;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:13pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">2. Commission Structure</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Affiliates will earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">commissions</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"> on every sale through their unique referral link. This commission may increase based on the monthly sales:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px 0pt;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹0 - ₹50,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">6% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹50,001 - ₹1,00,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">7% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹1,00,001 - ₹1,50,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">8% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹1,50,001 - 2,00,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">9% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹2,00,001 - 2,50,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">10% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹2,50,001 - 3,00,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">11% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹3,00,001 - 3,50,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">12% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹3,50,001 - 4,00,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">13% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹4,00,001 - 4,50,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">14% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹4,50,001 - 5,00,000/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">15% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px 12pt;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Sales of ₹5,00,001 or above/month:</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> Earn </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">16% commission</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\"> on all sales.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<hr style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding:0px;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;white-space:normal;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:13pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">3. Exclusive Discount for Affiliates</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Affiliates are eligible to purchase Yufta products at an exclusive </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">15% discount</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">. This discount is valid on the affiliate's </span><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">content creation/personal purchases</span></strong><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<hr style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding:0px;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;white-space:normal;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:13pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">4. Payment Terms</span></strong></h3>\n<ul style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px 0pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Commissions will be paid on <strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\">7th</strong> of every current month for preceding month.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Payments will be made through a preferred method (e.g., UPI, bank transfer, PayPal, etc.), once a minimum balance of ₹2,500 is accumulated.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px 12pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Affiliates are responsible for any taxes or other legal obligations that may arise from their earnings.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<hr style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding:0px;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;white-space:normal;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:13pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">5. Affiliate Responsibilities</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">As a Yufta affiliate, you agree to:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px 0pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Promote Yufta products and brands in a manner that reflects the high standards of quality and style.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Share your unique affiliate link through social media, blogs, vlogs, or any other platform.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Disclose any paid partnerships or affiliate relationships clearly to your audience (as per local laws or platform guidelines).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px 12pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Ensure that all content, including images, reviews, and videos, is original, honest, and follows Yufta's guidelines.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<hr style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding:0px;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;white-space:normal;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:13pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">6. Prohibited Activities</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Affiliates are prohibited from:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px 0pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Engaging in fraudulent activities or using unethical means (e.g., clickbait, false advertising) to promote Yufta products.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Using any deceptive or misleading methods to drive traffic or generate sales.</span></p>\n</li>\