gin:0pt 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Fraudulent activity, deceptive practices, or behavior that negatively impacts the brand.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px 12pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Failure to generate sales for 3 consecutive months without prior communication.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<hr style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding:0px;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;white-space:normal;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:13pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">8. Affiliate Support</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Yufta will provide affiliates with:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins;font-size:medium;white-space:normal;\">\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:12pt 0px 0pt;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Access to marketing materials, such as images/videos of products.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0pt 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-size:11pt;\">Affiliate tracking tools to monitor sales performance.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding:0